        "latex": "M_{Rd}\\coloneq\\begin{array}{||l}\\mathrm{if}\\ \\eta_{min}\\le\\eta\\land4d_{sc}\\le h_{sc}\\land\\beta_f\\le9\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle M_{a.Rd}+\\eta\\left(M_{pl.Rd}-M_{a.Rd}\\right)\\right.\\\\\\mathrm{else}\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle M_{a.Rd}\\right.\\end{array}",
